cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STEM-Alt, please cite it as below."
title: "STEM-Alt: An Adversarial Generator-Critic Loop with Human-Aligned Review for STEM Alt-Text"
abstract: >-
  STEM-Alt is a generator, critic, and human loop that converts a small set of
  dual human ratings into a domain-specific open-weights critic (LLaVA-Next-7B
  with LoRA, fine-tuned by Direct Preference Optimization) that approximates
  human judgement on STEM alt-text scoring, so the long tail of scientific
  figures can be checked with sparse human oversight. Comprises a calibrated
  critic checkpoint, a CC-BY corpus, and a born-accessible reference
  implementation validated against the DIAGRAM guidelines and WCAG 2.2 SC 1.1.1.
type: software
